      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Detached four bedroom house.\r\nRequires refurbishment.\r\nSouth west facing garden to the rear.\r\nWell located in a large residential development with well maintained communal green areas.\r\nWithin 500m of University Hospitial Waterford and within walking distance of all amenities in Waterford city centre.\r\nExtending to approximately 117 sq. m (1,259 sq. ft).\r\nVacant possession.\r\n\r\nThis property provides a detached four bedroom house with gardens to the front and rear. The property is arranged over ground and one upper floor beneath a pitched roof. This property offers off street parking. We are informed the property extends to approximately 117 sq. m (1,259 sq. ft).\r\n\r\nVacant Possession."
